00:41:21,454 --> 00:41:26,816
So now we don't have to use the physical server as is, we can split it virtually.

422
00:41:27,118 --> 00:41:30,416
So we're not going to bring a saw and cut into the server.

423
00:41:30,576 --> 00:41:32,580
It's a software that will

424
00:41:33,230 --> 00:41:36,964
divide the resources virtually in software only

