07:23:41,678 --> 07:23:49,028
The server, because it understands TCP and it knows the protocol, it will understand that this format is for a synchronization message.

5007
07:23:49,216 --> 07:23:51,908
Someone is trying to establish a connection with me.

5008
07:23:52,176 --> 07:23:56,256
So after that, they will exchange data with me. So

5009
07:23:56,336 --> 07:23:59,456
it will send a SYN act acknowledging the SIN.

