Please retransmit that message because I didn't get

5016
07:24:38,350 --> 07:24:48,656
it. They will make sure that the messages are received without errors and with acknowledgments of the receipt and retransmission if there are any missed or unreliable or erroneous

5017
07:24:48,816 --> 07:24:49,092
packets.

5018
07:24:50,030 --> 07:24:50,820
Basically,

5019
07:24:51,790 --> 07:24:59,296
this kind of communication ensures that 100% of the data is delivered, nothing is missed, and nothing is erroneous.

