6152
09:05:49,008 --> 09:05:53,488
Because in AWS, security groups are stateful.

6153
09:05:54,030 --> 09:06:05,060
If you allow traffic in one direction by allowing the rule, whether it is outbound or inbound, if it was outbound, the response coming back will be inbound to the firewall.

