11:01:21,728 --> 11:01:28,928
on a database called SQLite, and this is available online for free, and that is why we're going to do it.

7556
11:01:29,008 --> 11:01:36,484
Of course, as you learn through the cloud, there will be a lot of AWS services or Azure services or Google services that are databases,

7557
11:01:36,782 --> 11:01:41,284
and you will get the chance to work with them in applications and in projects.

