8607
12:19:56,112 --> 12:20:03,712
When a team or a company would like to build an application or build a tool, what is the process?

8608
12:20:03,872 --> 12:20:12,432
What's the workflow that from the time the need or the requirements and the planning were done all the way until the code is done,

8609
12:20:12,592 --> 12:20:13,604
tested, and deployed.

8610
12:20:14,158 --> 12:20:17,316
This is called SDLC, Software Development Lifecycle.

8611
12:20:17,582 --> 12:20:22,276
So let's go ahead and explore that because it relates to everything we're going to talk about.

8612
12:20:25,390 --> 12:20:31,620
Any application or software goes through several steps from the idea all the way to deployment.

8613
12:20:32,352 --> 12:20:38,756
We have, let's say, the startup, the company, or a business unit, they have requirements.

8614
12:20:39,246 --> 12:20:44,612
So these requirements are going to feed into a team, and that team will start doing the planning.

8615
12:20:45,486 --> 12:20:52,996
And in the planning, they will say, okay, this is what we need to build, this is how much it will cost, this is how much it will take, these are the required resources, and so on.

8616
12:20:54,542 --> 12:20:57,604
So development team and project managers and all that are assigned.

8617
12:20:57,902 --> 12:21:02,916
They start working on code and they start collaborating in a repo, in a repository.

8618
12:21:03,438 --> 12:21:12,484
Then we have the build and QA and testing teams that are going to be testing the code as it is developed or after it is developed.

8619
12:21:13,312 --> 12:21:19,872
And depending on the manifests of tests that needs to be done, they will find out if there are any issues.

8620
12:21:20,078 --> 12:21:26,512
If there are issues, they will send feedback to the developers and then iterate through this until the software and the code is

8621
12:21:26,512 --> 12:21:32,708
ready. So this is true for any software development. So let's go ahead and find out what are these steps.

8622
12:21:35,630 --> 12:21:39,652
So the software development workflow will go through the following steps: planning.

8623
12:21:41,070 --> 12:21:48,516
Then we're going to go through identifying the teams, the development teams, assigning the jobs to them, and then they will start coding.

8624
12:21:49,582 --> 12:21:57,476
After coding, or maybe during, depending on which methodology they are going to use, there will be building of the code from the different developers.

8625
12:21:58,158 --> 12:22:04,032
Then performing testing in order to find out errors or bugs or malfunctions in the code.

8626
12:22:04,334 --> 12:22:09,956
