8628
12:22:18,510 --> 12:22:26,532
Releasing means the software is ready or the application is ready or the new version is ready, and then deployment means it gets implemented in production.

8629
12:22:27,342 --> 12:22:34,084
Then comes the operation and monitoring phase, and then this cycle repeats as we enhance and add more features and so on.

8630
12:22:34,606 --> 12:22:38,912
So this is called the SDLC, the software development lifecycle.

8631
12:22:40,462 --> 12:22:46,692
Of course, it is critical if we need good quality software with less problems, less errors.

8632
12:22:47,152 --> 12:22:54,752
